This file documents the directory structure of the
Marinetti Open Source Project CVS repository.

For the integrity of the project please keep to the
intent of these directories when adding files to the
repository.
 
Assembler Link files and Object files should not be
added to the repository. At the current time, not all
source files exist to generate a complete build.
Please read the PrepareDevEnv document for more information.
 
Please note that Merlin source files must have their
high-bits stripped before being imported, added, updated
or committed to the repository. Use the '^' command
from the Merlin main menu to save the source file
without high-bits. This can also be scripted with the
Merlin command COPYFORK.

Applications - directory for applications that use Marinetti
Marinetti - MOSP high level directory
Marinetti\CDev - build files for TCPIP Control Panel
Marinetti\Documentation - user documentation for final releases
Marinetti\Equates - shared Equates files
Marinetti\Icons - filetype and Icon information
Marinetti\Init - build files for TCPIP Init
Marinetti\LinkLayers - subdirectories for Link Layers
Marinetti\LinkLayers\DC - build files for Direct Connect LL
Marinetti\LinkLayers\MacIP - build files for MacIP LL
Marinetti\LinkLayers\PPP - build files for PPP LL
Marinetti\LinkLayers\PPPX - build files for Scripted PPP LL
Marinetti\LinkLayers\SLIP - build files for SLIP LL
Marinetti\ToolStub - build files for Tool054
Tools - Assembler/Compiler specific items
Tools\InstallMagic - input files for Installer builder application
Tools\GSoftBASIC - TCP/IP tool interface files
Tools\Merlin - Merlin 16 specific items
Tools\Merlin\Commands - Shell command object files (EXE)
Tools\Merlin\Help.Files - Documentation for Command files
Tools\Merlin\Library - Subroutine library files (LNK)
Tools\Merlin\Macros - Macro source files
Tools\Merlin\Scripts - Script (link) files for doing useful things
Tools\NiftyList - TCP/IP tool interface files
Tools\Orca.C - TCP/IP tool interface files
Tools\Orca.M - TCP/IP tool interface files
Tools\Orca.Pascal - TCP/IP tool interface files
Tools\System - IIgs System tool sets that Marinetti uses
Tools\System\Crypto - build files for Crypto tool set
Utilities - Directory for development and debugging utilities
